  "open": "Open",
  "faqObservationQ": "How do I record an observation?",
  "faqObservationA": "On the map, tap \"+\" or long-press a spot. Choose the species (or type a name if it is not in the catalog), the date, the location and optionally a photo. GPS data is removed from the photo file.",
  "faqLocationQ": "Who sees where I was?",
  "faqLocationA": "Public observations show the exact point, except for threatened species or if you turn on \"hide location\": then others only see an area of about 10 km. Private observations are only visible to you.",
  "faqNotebookQ": "Are my notebooks saved automatically?",
  "faqNotebookA": "Yes. Each page is saved a few seconds after every change; you will see \"Saved\" at the top. If the same page changed on another device, the app warns you instead of overwriting it.",
  "faqTrashQ": "I deleted a notebook, can I get it back?",
  "faqTrashA": "Yes, for 30 days: Settings → Field notebook → Trash → Restore. It comes back with all its pages.",
  "faqOldAppQ": "What happened to my content from the previous app?",
  "faqOldAppA": "It was copied to this app: profile, notebooks and their pages, photos, followers, messages and album. You sign in with the same Google or email account. Anything you create in the previous app after the copy does not appear here automatically.",
  "faqOfflineQ": "Does it work offline?",
  "faqOfflineA": "Not yet. Maps, notebooks and observations need a connection. We prefer not to show a \"download map\" button until it really works.",
  "faqMissingQ": "Why are some options from the previous app missing?",
  "faqMissingA": "We only include options that work. Not available yet: SMS two-step verification, signing out of all devices, satellite or offline maps, trading stickers and cards between people, phone or email notifications, and languages other than Spanish and English. We also do not ask for ID numbers, birth date, gender or address: they are not needed.",
  "faqContactQ": "How do I report a problem?",
  "faqContactA": "For inappropriate content, use \"Report\" on the post or profile. For bugs or ideas: Settings → Contact.",
  "legalDraftNotice": "Preliminary plain-language version. It describes how the app works today.",
  "legalDataTitle": "What data we store",
  "legalDataBody": "Your email and sign-in method; what you write in your profile; your posts, comments, messages, observations (with their location), notebooks, photos and audio; and your preferences. We do not ask for ID numbers, birth date, gender or address. If you turn on fingerprint or face unlock, your phone does the comparison: we never receive or store biometric data.",
  "legalUseTitle": "What we use them for",
  "legalUseBody": "Only to make the app work: showing your content, the biodiversity map and the community. We do not sell data or show ads.",
  "legalLocationTitle": "Location",
  "legalLocationBody": "The app only uses your location when you ask (the \"my location\" button or when recording an observation). Photos are stored without their GPS data. Threatened species are shown to others with an approximate location.",
  "legalProvidersTitle": "Services we use",
  "legalProvidersBody": "Firebase Authentication (Google) for sign-in. Cloudflare (Workers and D1) to store data and files. Maps load from OpenStreetMap and OpenTopoMap, which receive your IP address when showing the map.",
  "legalRightsTitle": "Your rights",
  "legalRightsBody": "You can view and correct your profile, download a copy of all your data and delete your account from Settings. Deleting it removes your content from our servers; files are removed in the daily cleanup.",
  "legalTermsTitle": "Rules of use",
  "legalTermsBody": "Respect other people and nature: do not post other people's personal data, offensive content or locations that put species at risk. We may hide reported content that breaks these rules.",
